abstract: >-
  A closed, prospectively constrained evaluation of evidence-status overclaiming
  in a tool-using local language-model setting. The final E3-A run observed
  18/24 operational STATUS_OVERCLAIM events in forced-ambiguity cases, while
  no family passed the preregistered 6/6 matched-control competence gate.
